  <div class="ss-body">
    <p class="ss-lede">Every reviewer complaint maps to a rule and to a screen where you can see it fixed. The first table counts the items each screen demonstrates. The full matrix follows.</p>
    <div class="pm-table-scroll"><table class="pm-table ss-plain ss-wide"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Screen</th><th scope="col">Items</th><th scope="col">Reviewer items it demonstrates</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<!--COVERAGE_SUMMARY-->
    </tbody></table></div>
    <details class="pm-details"><summary>Full matrix (<!--COVERAGE_COUNT--> rows)</summary><div class="pm-details-body">
